    "text": "<p>The combination of plots which does not represent isothermal expansion of an ideal gas is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"218\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1102d293-2946-4257-98ce-e970539b2883-image.png\" width=\"197\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"215\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5ae9c384-6cb9-4ea3-b1c2-32d55c7eda55-image.png\" width=\"195\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced></math> <img height=\"212\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e39874e8-3e73-4fa0-a9cf-58d7a11f6774-image.png\" width=\"240\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"220\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3b813919-9505-47be-8a4d-13f37c9529c3-image.png\" width=\"195\" /></p>",
